; ------------------ Manual override: subscription:true -----------------------
; A metered service whose bill swings far too much to cluster, so detection
; never sees it. One tagged transaction is enough to put it on the list. Note
; the comma before the tag on the last one: a tag value runs to the next comma,
; so without it the tag would be swallowed by `category:`.
